OL,3,ASoho House venue under investigation
OL,4,Afor food safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA venue of private members club Soho
OL,7,FHouse is being investigated by the
OL,8,Flocal council after a former member of
OL,9,Fstaff raised concerns about rats and
OL,10,Fout-of-date food allegedly being
OL,11,Fserved.
OL,13,FThe former staff member told BBC News
OL,14,Fhe was pressured to replace labels on
OL,15,Fprepared food if it was not sold at the
OL,16,Fend of the day and said he regularly
OL,17,Fsaw rats at the venue.
OL,19,FHis contract was terminated two months
OL,20,Fafter he first raised concerns, but
OL,21,FSoho House said this was unrelated to
OL,22,Fhis complaints.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
